ist the names of any affiliated corporations referred to in that statement; (d) include a copy of any statements of disclosure filed by the Member under subsections 14(3), 15(1) and 21(3); (e) list the positions and corporations, trade or professional associations and trade unions disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(e); and (f) list any trusts disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(b.1). Tony Baldinelli · Member of Parliament Declaration type Disclosure Summaries (Code) Disclosure date November 27, 2025 Regime Conflict of Interest Code for Members of the House of Commons Description LiabilitiesCar loan with Royal Bank of Canada Spouse's/Common-Law Partner's assetsJoint ownership, with other individuals, of a rental farmland located in Niagara Falls, OntarioSpouse's/Common-Law Partner's source(s) of incomeLast 12 months: Employment income from Regional Municipality of NiagaraNext 12 months: Employment income from Regional Municipality of Niagara Disclosed on November 27, 2025","url":"https://www.ethicscanada.ca/en/public-registry/Details?declarationId=04d1799e-226c-4869-a767-a0cd984250bf"}],"other":[]},"lobbying":{"total":512,"first":"2020-01-26","last":"2026-08-21","byYear":{"2020":65,"2021":84,"2022":74,"2023":64,"2024":104,"2025":69,"2026":52},"topSubjects":[["Tourism",116],["Industry",76],["Taxation and Finance",66],["Environment",60],["Transportation",58],["International Trade",55],["Economic Development",45],["Agriculture",36]],"topOrgs":[["Tourism Industry Association of Canada",25],["Hotels Canada",24],["WINE GROWERS CANADA",20],["Frontier Duty Free Association",15],["Canadian Vehicle Manufacturers' Association",13],["GENERAL MOTORS OF CANADA COMPANY",13],["Canadian Automobile Dealers Association (CADA)",12],["HONDA CANADA INC.",10]]}}